[2https://www.bing.com/translator](https://www.bing.com/translator)
[3https://aws.amazon.com/translate](https://aws.amazon.com/translate)
[4http://www.systransoft.com](http://www.systransoft.com)
[5https://github.com/pytorch/fairseq](https://github.com/pytorch/fairseq)

